Error [jet.DestructureShapeMismatch]: `nme` isn't a member of (name: String, package: String)
  --> tests/ui/loop_tuple_destructure_unknown_name.jet:2:20
    |
  2 |     loop (package, nme) in [(package: "a", name: "b")] {
    |                    ^^^
 Why: A tuple destructure binds each member by its name, never by position
 Fix: Name the members, `(name, package): …`, or rename them: `{ name: name, package: name }: …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0313
